- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:15.198 --> 00:00:17.940
- There was a very funny video online.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.200
So tell everybody what happened.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.072
- There's this wonderful
person on Instagram.

00:00:23.072 --> 00:00:27.000
I wish I knew. It's Texas
Bee Lady or something.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.020
- Of course she's from Texas. Okay.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.460
- Please when you-
(Keegan-Michael laughs)

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.540
- Of course.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.100
- I want to give her the
credit that it's due.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.020
She's fantastic. I love
watching her on Instagram.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:34.853
You guys follow this gal?

00:00:34.853 --> 00:00:36.990
She like has the most amazing demeanor.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:37.860
I can't think of her name right now,

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.090
so put it on the screen or something.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.307
It's this. This is her name.

00:00:40.307 --> 00:00:41.910
- [Kelly] (laughs) Up here.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:44.430
- And if you act fast...
(Kelly claps)

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:45.630
But it's this gal
(Jack laughs)

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.520
and she's like very calm in her voice

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.480
and she's like, "Today
I saw a hive of bees

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:53.910
in the floor of a baseball dugout."

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.570
And she takes out the floor and
there's like 4 million bees.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.630
She knows, she just reaches
in there with her hands

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:03.960
and they're all over her
and she finds the queen

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:05.070
and puts it in a hair clip.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:07.650
I'll watch, I go like a
k-hole of this Bee Lady

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.660
for like four hours watching her video.

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:10.740
She's fantastic and-

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:12.150
- It's amazing they let
her touch the queen.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:12.983
- It is.

00:01:12.983 --> 00:01:14.310
No, and then she'll put it away

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:15.600
and then she moves them all.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:16.830
They just love her.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.120
They never sting her. She's cool.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.190
So I, of course, watch
four hours of these videos.

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:21.600
I'm like, "I got this down."

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:25.170
And we were looking at a house,

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.100
this house that was for sale.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:30.660
We went to go tour it and
just saw this big beehive.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:32.220
And the real estate agent
was like, "Hey, careful,

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:33.270
there's a big beehive over there."

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:35.395
I'm like, (laughs) "We're okay."

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.750
(audience laughs)
(Kelly chuckles)

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.759
I was like, "Yeah, they
do look like honeybees."

00:01:39.759 --> 00:01:41.880
(guests laugh)

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.500
And they're like, (imitates bees buzzing)

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.716
I was like, trust me, if
you're calm they won't.

00:01:46.716 --> 00:01:48.736
(Chris shouts)
(guests laugh)

00:01:48.736 --> 00:01:50.730
Then it stung me right in
the eyeball, like right here.

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:52.290
I was like, oh. (shouts)
(Jack laughs)

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.150
And so there it is.

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:56.280
You can see my eye there.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.270
She got me good

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:01.770
and then I was like I think
I may have jokingly said

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:03.600
like (beep) the Bee Lady in the video.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.150
And then she roasted me
in the comments section.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.904
And anyways, we're kind of friends.

00:02:07.904 --> 00:02:08.904
- [Kelly] Oh my god. That's amazing.

00:02:08.904 --> 00:02:09.810
- [Keegan-Michael] You guys
are kind of friends now.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.040
- No, I don't know.

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.350
She, after roasting me, she
hasn't returned my calls.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:14.183
- [Kelly] It's fine.

00:02:14.183 --> 00:02:15.420
- She seems really-

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:16.253
Give her a follow.

00:02:16.253 --> 00:02:18.300
She's actually really fantastic.
She's a really cool gal.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:20.070
- I do think it's incredible
when people do stuff like that.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.090
- Oh my gosh, yeah she's-

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:23.200
- But she should say, "Don't
try this at home, Chris Pratt."

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:24.033
- I think she does.
- Yeah, yeah.

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:26.820
- I think she probably. (laughs)

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:29.434
- Please don't follow any
like snake or bear people.

00:02:29.434 --> 00:02:30.718
- Yeah.
- Yes. (laughs)

00:02:30.718 --> 00:02:31.551
- You know, because.
- That's gonna go bad.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:33.720
- You're like the little
boy that watched Peter Pan.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:36.422
Like watch this mom and you're
like flying from the roof.

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:37.410
(guests laughing)
- No, I have an umbrella.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:39.297
I'll be fine. (shouts) Oh my god!

00:02:39.297 --> 00:02:41.332
- Mary Poppins did it. Yeah.

00:02:41.332 --> 00:02:42.240
(laughs) That's amazing.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:45.750
Well Charlie, speaking of
wildlife, you found a random cat.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:46.943
So let's see that.
- I did.

00:02:46.943 --> 00:02:48.480
Like we have footage?

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:49.980
Is your cat black?
(playful music)

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.440
Does your cat have a
white stripe on its noses?

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:55.137
Does your cat have no microchip

00:02:55.137 --> 00:02:57.300
