00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.463
Then maybe your cat is this cat.

00:03:05.799 --> 00:03:06.973
I got your cat.

00:03:06.973 --> 00:03:08.557
- Got your cat.
- I got your cat.

00:03:08.557 --> 00:03:10.455
(audience cheers)
(all laugh)

00:03:10.455 --> 00:03:13.230
- Did you? That's the most amazing ad.

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.610
So wait, did you find the owner?

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.530
- Yeah, that's my cat now. Yeah. Yeah.

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:18.120
That cat lives with me.
- Oh you now own the cat.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:18.959
It was a stray.

00:03:18.959 --> 00:03:21.690
