me for almost two years now.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.400
That cat has been named Oreo.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:28.200
- [Kelly] Oh my god.
- By my son.

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.900
That cat rules the house and the dogs

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.340
and the cat's in charge.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:33.580
- [Kelly] Yeah. That's cats for you.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.950
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:36.661
We're moving out but
the cat's staying there.

00:03:36.661 --> 00:03:39.030
(all laughing)

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.820
- Jack, this is not
wildlife but it looks wild.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.896
