00:03:43.896 --> 00:03:45.120
- [Jack] Oh.
(audience laughs)

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:45.953
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:03:45.953 --> 00:03:47.370
- Okay, so-
- It's a lot happening.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.810
