join the truth or dare.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:17.160
And I was like I'm not going
to do the truth or dare.

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:18.330
And my wife said, "What
are you talking about?

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.980
It's Madonna, you have to go."

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:20.813
I was like, okay.

00:04:20.813 --> 00:04:22.230
I got permission from my wife

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:23.933
