00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.840
I love it. (laughs)

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.162
It's special relationship.

00:04:41.162 --> 00:04:42.690
(guests laugh)
That's amazing.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:45.510
